[*]
[*] GTKWave layout for test/wave/ser_frame.vcd: the serialiser sending the chip test's Ethernet frame.
[*] Open with test/wave/open_ser_frame.bat (or: gtkwave ser_frame.vcd ser_frame.gtkw), GTKWave 4.
[*] Clock 100 MHz in the test bench (10 ns), SERDIV 0: one half-bit per clock. Times are in picoseconds.
[*] Opens on the first clocks of the frame (marker at the first word load). Other views (type into From / To):
[*]   whole recording           2496000000 to 2602125000  the buffer fills over SPI, then empties as the frame goes
[*]   end of data, CRC, marker  2599300000 to 2600200000  phase 1 -> 2 (CRC) -> 3 (end marker), then idle
[*]
